# M14 "Pazar", flow "two_clients_shop" side A (EnterVitals = 10): an Aydor warrior sells its axe to the
# Ortaocak smith, buys a Kızılca Şerbet from Sürmeli Bacı, waits for the Kargan of side B
# (two_shop_b.voscript) to come close and drinks it; B sees the green number over A and sits down (the
# signal that it is done).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m14_two_a
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Icici
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown+npcs2 1800
scene talk Demirci Ilgaz
waitfor world+shopopen+inv 900
rclickon inv.bag.0
waitfor world+sold1+shopidle 600
scene expectcoins = 10
scene talk Sürmeli Bacı
waitfor world+shopopen+inv 900
scene shopbuy 16 1
waitfor world+modal+quantitybox 120
key enter
waitfor world+bought1+shopidle 600
key escape
wait 3
expect world+shopclosed
# Sit down: the signal for B to come over.
scene stance sit
waitfor world+serversitting 300
waitfor world+remotes1 3600
scene markremote Seyirci
waitfor world+remotenear8 3600
waitfor world+remotestill 3600
wait 30
scene usepotion 16
waitfor world+potionuses1 300
wait 5
scene camera at:Seyirci 30 7
wait 5
screenshot a01_drank_next_to_b.png
waitfor world+remotesitting 1800
quit
